  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Horticulture Systems &amp; Trade (HDC Supported Initiative)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support to the horticulture sector initiative aims to strengthen Zimbabwe&apos;s horticultural ecosystem through facilitation of improved export readiness, enhanced cross-sector coordination and a demonstrated model of climate-smart, market-driven horticulture development. 
 The project is anchored in two core pillars: Pillar 1 &#x2014; Investment and Trade, with a strong emphasis on inward and outward investment fora, trade facilitation, and unlocking private capital; and Pillar 2 &#x2014; Systems Strengthening and Policy Reform, consolidating HDC&apos;s role as Zimbabwe&apos;s national horticulture apex body and advancing the policy environment for investment and trade.</narrative>
  </description>
